== A documentation claim that was ahead of the code ==
app/README.md said "every card shows the risk label as text and an icon alongside the colour". Before B12 the cards
drew no risk icon at all: the icon existed only in the results-screen legend. The sentence is true as of this item,
and the README now says it was not true before, rather than quietly becoming correct. The same file claimed a
"Material 3 theme (light and dark)"; only light is wired, and it now says so.

